        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/7cb7ec52ef90f12aeea45c99044efb4f.avif?t=1756499782\" alt=\"Zodiac Mermaid\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise fish, evolve them into mermaids, and become an aquarium tycoon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream aquarium in this relaxing simulation game! Raise fish and watch them evolve into beautiful mermaids. Manage resources, decorate your aquatic paradise, and grow your aquarium business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100 mermaids and sea creatures through relaxing gameplay. Enjoy fun match-3 puzzles and merge challenges as you expand your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Dream Aquarium\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise, Collect, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most relaxing fish collecting experience! Watch adorable sea creatures swim peacefully in your aquariums - from tiny clownfish to mysterious pirate lanternfish. Each fish has its own personality and charm, creating a soothing atmosphere perfect for unwinding after a long day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Relaxing Fish\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Fish into Legendary Mermaids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the magic as your ordinary fish transform into stunning mermaids! Through careful nurturing and special care, watch your aquatic friends undergo amazing evolutionary changes. Collect dozens of unique mermaid species, each with their own beautiful design and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Mermaid Evolution\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Aquarium World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design every corner of your aquarium paradise! Choose from hundreds of decorative items - palm trees, coral reefs, guide shelves, and themed decorations. Create different zones for different creatures, build walking paths for visitors, and craft the perfect aquatic environment that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Custom Building\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Smart, Be a Tycoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a successful aquarium business! Harvest raw materials, develop visitor products, and manage your resources wisely. Balance your fish care, decoration budget, and souvenir production to build the world's most profitable aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Goods Production\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>※ Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Collect 100+ mermaids and sea animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Raise fish and evolve them into mythical mermaids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Decorate and customize your aquarium with hundreds of themed items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Craft souvenirs and trade rare items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Enjoy diverse mini-games, including match-3 and merge puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Team up with friends and compete in global leaderboards</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/7cb7ec52ef90f12aeea45c99044efb4f.avif?t=1756499782\" alt=\"Zodiac Mermaid\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise fish, evolve them into mermaids, and become an aquarium tycoon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream aquarium in this relaxing simulation game! Raise fish and watch them evolve into beautiful mermaids. Manage resources, decorate your aquatic paradise, and grow your aquarium business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100 mermaids and sea creatures through relaxing gameplay. Enjoy fun match-3 puzzles and merge challenges as you expand your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Dream Aquarium\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c50f0947051213d8ebc5b815add556e4.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise, Collect, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most relaxing fish collecting experience! Watch adorable sea creatures swim peacefully in your aquariums - from tiny clownfish to mysterious pirate lanternfish. Each fish has its own personality and charm, creating a soothing atmosphere perfect for unwinding after a long day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Relaxing Fish\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58937141434c989eaa42a55776e45145.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Fish into Legendary Mermaids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the magic as your ordinary fish transform into stunning mermaids! Through careful nurturing and special care, watch your aquatic friends undergo amazing evolutionary changes. Collect dozens of unique mermaid species, each with their own beautiful design and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Mermaid Evolution\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/58c660f1c79a09d8f68415777a394cec.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Aquarium World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design every corner of your aquarium paradise! Choose from hundreds of decorative items - palm trees, coral reefs, guide shelves, and themed decorations. Create different zones for different creatures, build walking paths for visitors, and craft the perfect aquatic environment that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Custom Building\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/247bd6cd8ea29aa2e6d4dfaa0d3f027f.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Smart, Be a Tycoon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a successful aquarium business! Harvest raw materials, develop visitor products, and manage your resources wisely. Balance your fish care, decoration budget, and souvenir production to build the world's most profitable aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.poster.avif?t=1756499782\" aria-label=\"Goods Production\" width=614 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.webm?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386340/extras/c0d34a3a10741f56fd1a988c0e771cdf.mp4?t=1756499782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>※ Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Collect 100+ mermaids and sea animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Raise fish and evolve them into mythical mermaids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Decorate and customize your aquarium with hundreds of themed items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Craft souvenirs and trade rare items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Enjoy diverse mini-games, including match-3 and merge puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >► Team up with friends and compete in global leaderboards</p>",
